the whole process,

00:02:31.450 --> 00:02:33.980
be it internal or
external users.

00:02:33.980 --> 00:02:36.710
And so the platform is really
kind of agnostic of that fact.

00:02:36.710 --> 00:02:38.710
But we, of course, provide
a lot of safeguarding

00:02:38.710 --> 00:02:40.300
